    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kiyatakin ekimar a ŋituŋa alotaun",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apaki ŋin eboiyete ŋikarikok a ŋituŋa alo Yerusalem, ido apotu ŋituŋa ŋuluce kilamilama aŋuna ka ayaun ituŋanan ipei alotooma ŋitomon akiboi alo Yerusalem, alotaun a ŋolo asegan, kidoŋo ŋituŋa ŋikanikaomwon alotooma ŋitomon akiboi alotaunio a ŋuluce. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ŋituŋa kiterereŋo ŋituŋa daadaŋ ŋulu apotu toloto a acamit kec akiboi alo Yerusalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erae lu ŋikarikok a ŋituŋa akwap a ŋin ŋulu eboiyete alo Yerusalem, nai eboiyete alotaunio a Yudaya Ŋisirael ŋuluce, ŋisacaradotin, ŋilepi ŋiketiyak a Akai ka Akuj ka ŋiletok a ŋiketiyak a Solomon ka analup ka alotaunio kec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tosodi eboiyete alo Yerusalem ŋituŋa a Yudaya ŋice ka ŋituŋa a Benjamin ŋice. Aloletok a Yudaya, ŋulu eboiyete alo Yerusalem ikes lu: Asalia lokoku a Usia, a ŋolo arae lokoku a Sakariya, a ŋolo arae lokoku a Amaria, a ŋolo arae lokoku a Sepatia, a ŋolo arae lokoku a Maalalel; arae ŋul ŋiletok a Peres; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maaseia lokoku a Baruk, a ŋolo arae lokoku a Kooles, a ŋolo arae lokoku a Asaia, a ŋolo arae lokoku ka Adaia, a ŋolo arae lokoku a Yoiarib, a ŋolo arae lokoku a Sakariya, a ŋolo arae lokoku a Silonite. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋiletok a Peres daadaŋ ŋulu eboiyete alo Yerusalem arae ekimar kec ŋamiae ŋaomwon ka ŋatomonikanikapei ka ŋikanikauni, arae ikes ŋikilyok ŋulu adedeŋak.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋituŋa a Benjamin ŋulu eboiyete alo Yerusalem ikes lu: Salu lokoku a Mesulam, a ŋolo arae lokoku a Yoed, a ŋolo arae lokoku a Pedaia, a ŋolo arae lokoku a Kolaia, a ŋolo arae lokoku a Maaseia, a ŋolo arae lokoku a Isiel, a ŋolo arae lokoku a Yesaia, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ido ŋikaitotoi keŋ lu: Gabai ka Salai, arae ekimar kec a daadaŋ ŋamiae ŋikanikaomwon ka ŋatomoniarei ka ŋakanikauni ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoel lokoku a Sikiri iŋes apolokinit ikes ka Yuda lokoku ka Asenua iŋes ewuapit anapolou ekapolokiniton a etaun.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋisacaradotin ŋulu eboiyete alo Yerusalem ikes lu: Yedaia lokoku a Yoiarib, Yakin, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Seraia lokoku ka Ilikia, a ŋolo arae lokoku a Mesulam, a ŋolo arae lokoku a Sadok, a ŋolo arae lokoku a Meraios, a ŋolo arae lokoku ka Aitub, arae Seraia ekapolon alo Kai ka Akuj ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ka ŋirukitos kec ŋulu etiyaete etic alo Kai ka Akuj arae ekimar kec a daadaŋ ŋamiae ŋakanikauni ka ŋatomoniarei ka ŋaarei, arukito daŋ ikes ka Adalia lokoku a Yeroam, a ŋolo arae lokoku a Pelalia, a ŋolo arae lokoku ka Amisi, a ŋolo arae lokoku a Sakariya, a ŋolo arae lokoku a Pasura, a ŋolo arae lokoku a Milikia ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ka ŋirukitos keŋ, ŋikapolokinitok ŋatekerin, arae ekimar kec a daadaŋ ŋamiae ŋaarei ka ŋatomoniomwon ka ŋiarei, ayai daŋ nen Amasai ŋolo arae lokoku ka Asarel, a ŋolo arae lokoku ka Asai, a ŋolo arae lokoku a Mesilemos, a ŋolo arae lokoku a Imer ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ka ŋirukitos keŋ, arae daadaŋ ŋikilyok ŋulu adedeŋak ka arae ekimar kec a daadaŋ amiat ka ŋatomoniarei ka ŋikanikauni, ido Sabidiel lokoku ka Agedolin iŋes apolokinit ikes.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋilepi ŋulu eboiyete alo Yerusalem ikes lu: Semaia lokoku ka Asub, a ŋolo arae lokoku a Asirikam, a ŋolo arae lokoku a Asabia, a ŋolo arae lokoku a Buni ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "arukito iŋes ka Sabesai ta Yosabad ŋulu arae ŋiarei alotooma ŋikapolokinitok a ŋilepi, apolokinito ikes ŋiticisyo ŋulu alokiŋa Akai ka Akuj, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ayai daŋ nen Matania lokoku a Mika a ŋolo arae lokoku a Sabidi, a ŋolo arae lokoku ka Asap, arae Matania ekarikon ŋolo ageununui akilip ŋina ka alakar neni ka Akuj. Aya nabo nen Bakibukia ŋolo ewuapit Matania anapolou aneni a ŋirukitos keŋ, Abeda lokoku a Samua, a ŋolo arae lokoku a Galal, a ŋolo arae lokoku a Yedusun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae ekimar a ŋilepi a daadaŋ a ŋulu ayakasi lotaun ŋolo asegan ŋamiae ŋaarei ka ŋatomonikanikauni ka ŋiomwon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋiketeok ŋipukei ŋulu eboiyete alo Yerusalem ikes lu: Akub ka Talimon ta ŋirukitos kec ŋulu eteoto ikes ŋipukei, arae ekimar kec a daadaŋ amiat ka ŋatomonikanikaarei ka ŋiarei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eboiyete Ŋisirael ŋuluce daadaŋ, ŋisacaradotin ka ŋilepi alotaunio a daadaŋ a ŋulu a Yudaya anakiboisyo a ŋuna sek aponi tokorakinae ikes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai eboiyete ŋiketiyak ka Akai ka Akuj anamukure Opel, ido Sia ka Gisipa ikes apolokinito ŋiketiyak a Akai ka Akuj.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekapolokiniton a ŋilepi a ŋulu eboiyete alo Yerusalem iŋes Usi lokoku a Bani, a ŋolo arae lokoku ka Asabia, a ŋolo arae lokoku a Matania, a ŋolo arae lokoku a Mika. Arae Usi epei a ŋiletok ka Asap a ŋulu arae ŋikaeok ŋulu apolokinito etic ŋolo ka Akai ka Akuj. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atubunit erwosit aŋuna a ŋikaeok atemar a ŋinakoloŋit emaikina inakinae ikes akimuj ŋina eitanito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tosodi Pesaia lokoku a Mesesabel eletonit ka Sera alokoku a Yuda, iŋes awoikinit ŋituŋa aŋuna ke erwosit.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋirerya ŋulu alo kiŋa Yerusalem",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
