          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sanoa, Adulam ka ŋirerya kec Lakis ka ŋimanikorin keŋ ka Eseka ka ŋirerya keŋ. Aŋun eboiyete ŋiletok a Yuda ameun alo Beeriseba tari Inom. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eboiyete ŋiletok a Benjamin daŋ alo Geba, Mikimas, Aiya, Besel ka ŋirerya keŋ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
